#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:115
msgid ""
"Create :ref:`attribute categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/attribute-"
"categories>` to better structure this section."
msgstr ""
"Crea :ref:`categorie di attributi <ecommerce/categories_variants/attribute-"
