#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:56
msgid "Linking Odoo to GMC"
msgstr "Collegare Odoo a GMC"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:59
msgid ""
"To use the :abbr:`GMC (Google Merchant Center)` integration in your Odoo "
"database, at least one :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` must "
