#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:42
msgid "Email queue optimization"
msgstr "Ottimizzazione della coda email"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:44
msgid ""
"For websites handling flash sales (e.g., event ticket sales) or experiencing "
"high traffic spikes, order confirmation emails can become a performance "
"bottleneck, potentially slowing down the checkout process for other "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"Per i siti web che gestiscono vendite flash (ad esempio vendita di biglietti "
"per eventi) o che subiscono picchi di traffico elevati, le email di conferma "
"ordine possono diventare un collo di bottiglia per le prestazioni, "
"rallentando potenzialmente il processo di checkout per altri clienti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:48
msgid ""
"To improve performance, these emails can be queued and processed separately "
"from the order confirmation flow. This is managed by the :guilabel:`Sales: "
"Send pending emails` scheduled action, which sends queued emails as soon as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"Per migliorare le prestazioni, queste email possono essere messe in coda ed "
"elaborate separatamente dal flusso di conferma ordine. Questo è gestito "
"dall'azione pianificata :guilabel:`Vendite: invia email in sospeso`, che "
"invia le email in coda il prima possibile."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:52
msgid "To enable asynchronous email sending:"
msgstr "Per abilitare l'invio asincrono delle email:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:54
msgid "Enable the :ref:`developer-mode`."
msgstr "Abilitare la :ref:`developer-mode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:55
msgid ""
"Open the Settings app and go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> "
"System Parameters`."
msgstr ""
"Aprire l'app Impostazioni e andare su :menuselection:`Impostazioni --> "
"Tecnico --> Parametri di sistema`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:56
msgid ""
"Search for the :guilabel:`sale.async_emails` system parameter, set "
"its :guilabel:`Value` to `True`, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Cercare il parametro di sistema :guilabel:`sale.async_emails`, impostare il "
"suo :guilabel:`Valore` su `True` e fare clic su :guilabel:`Salva`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:58
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Scheduled Actions`."
msgstr ""
"Andare su :menuselection:`Impostazioni --> Tecnico --> Azioni pianificate`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:59
msgid "Select the :guilabel:`Sales: Send pending emails` scheduled action."
msgstr ""
"Selezionare l'azione pianificata :guilabel:`Vendite: Invia email in sospeso`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:60
msgid "Ensure the :guilabel:`Active` switch is enabled."
msgstr "Assicurarsi che l'interruttore :guilabel:`Attivo` sia abilitato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/performance.rst:63
msgid ""
"This configuration is recommended only for high-traffic websites, as it may "
"introduce unnecessary delays for order confirmation and invoice emails on "
"websites with moderate traffic."
msgstr ""
"Questa configurazione è consigliata solo per siti web ad alto traffico, "
"poiché potrebbe introdurre ritardi non necessari per le email di conferma "
"ordine e fattura su siti web con traffico moderato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:3
msgid "Deliveries"
msgstr "Consegne"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce allows you to configure various delivery methods, enabling "
"customers to choose their preferred option at :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/"
"checkout/steps>`. These methods include integrations with :ref:`external "
"providers <ecommerce/shipping/external-provider>` as well as :ref:`custom "
"options <ecommerce/shipping/custom-method>` such as flat-rate shipping, free "
"shipping, or :ref:`in-store pickup <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo E-commerce consente di configurare vari metodi di consegna, permettendo "
"ai clienti di scegliere l'opzione preferita al :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/"
"checkout/steps>`. Questi metodi includono integrazioni con :ref:`fornitori "
"esterni <ecommerce/shipping/external-provider>` e :ref:`opzioni "
"personalizzate <ecommerce/shipping/custom-method>` come spedizione a tariffa "
"fissa, spedizione gratuita o :ref:`ritiro in negozio <ecommerce/shipping/"
"instore-pickup>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Configuring delivery methods </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Configurare metodi di consegna </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:18
msgid "External provider integration"
msgstr "Integrazione provider esterno"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:20
msgid ""
"You can integrate with :doc:`third-party shipping carriers </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"third_party_shipper>`, such as :doc:`FedEx </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/fedex>`, :doc:`UPS </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/ups_credentials>`, or :doc:`DHL </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"dhl_credentials>` to streamline shipping operations. Connecting with an "
"external provider allows to generate :doc:`tracking labels </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels>` "
"automatically and to offer customers several delivery options "
"at :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/steps>`."
msgstr ""
"È possibile integrarsi con :doc:`corrieri terzi </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"third_party_shipper>`, come :doc:`FedEx </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/fedex>`, :doc:`UPS </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/ups_credentials>` o :doc:`DHL </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"dhl_credentials>`, per semplificare le operazioni di spedizione. Collegarsi "
"a un fornitore esterno consente di generare automaticamente :doc:`etichette "
"di tracciamento </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels>` e di offrire ai clienti "
"diverse opzioni di consegna al :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/steps>`."

