#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:116
msgid "If a company has a *single* website, that website's domain is used."
msgstr ""
"Se un'azienda ha un *singolo* sito web, viene utilizzato il dominio di quel "
"sito web."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:117
