"kinds of webpages, including with the help of :ref:`AI <website/pages/ai-"
"generator>`, :ref:`publish <website/pages/un-publish-page>` them, and define "
"their structure and visibility by configuring :ref:`page properties <website/"
"pages/page_properties>`. Pages can be :ref:`duplicated <website/pages/"
"duplicate-page>`, :ref:`deleted <website/pages/delete-page>`, "
"and :ref:`redirected <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ti consente di :ref:`creare <website/pages/page_creation>` diversi tipi "
"di pagine web, anche con l'aiuto dell':ref:`AI <website/pages/ai-"
"generator>`, :ref:`pubblicarle <website/pages/un-publish-page>` e definire "
"la loro struttura e visibilità configurando le :ref:`proprietà della pagina "
"<website/pages/page_properties>`. Le pagine possono essere :ref:`duplicate "
"<website/pages/duplicate-page>`, :ref:`eliminate <website/pages/delete-"
"page>` e :ref:`reindirizzate <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:16
msgid "Page types"
msgstr "Tipi di pagina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Static** pages, such as the homepage or :ref:`custom <website/pages/"
"page_creation>` pages, contain fixed content that does not change "
"dynamically. You can manually create these pages, define their URLs, and "
"adapt their :ref:`properties <website/pages/page_properties>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"Le pagine **statiche**, come la homepage o le pagine :ref:`personalizzate "
"<website/pages/page_creation>`, contengono contenuti fissi che non cambiano "
"dinamicamente. Puoi creare manualmente queste pagine, definire i loro URL e "
"adattare le loro :ref:`proprietà <website/pages/page_properties>` secondo "
"necessità."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Dynamic** pages, on the other hand, display content that changes "
"automatically based on the data in the database and user interaction (e.g., "
"filtering). They are generated automatically by Odoo, for example, when "
"installing an app or module (e.g., `/shop` or `/blog`) or publishing a "
"new :doc:`product <../../ecommerce>` or :doc:`blog post <../../blog>`. "
"Dynamic pages are managed differently from static pages."
msgstr ""
"Le pagine **dinamiche**, invece, mostrano contenuti che cambiano "
"automaticamente in base ai dati nel database e all'interazione dell'utente "
"(ad es. filtraggio). Vengono generate automaticamente da Odoo, ad esempio "
"quando si installa un'app o un modulo (ad es. `/shop` o `/blog`) o si "
"pubblica un nuovo :doc:`prodotto <../../ecommerce>` o :doc:`post del blog "
"<../../blog>`. Le pagine dinamiche sono gestite in modo diverso rispetto "
"alle pagine statiche."

